   {
    "tag": "h1.text-7xl.font-bold",
    "text": "ALIAS: VNON",
    "_src": [
     "music.copy.033"
    ]
   },
   {
    "tag": "p.text-gray-400.font-mono",
    "text": "Under the alias vnon, I construct electronic music, focusing predominantly on the architectural complexities of Drum & Bass. Sound design serves as the central anchor for my work, translating spatial peak limits and transient modulations into procedural visual systems.",
    "_src": [
     "music.copy.034"
    ]
   },
   {
    "tag": "span.font-mono.text-accent",
    "text": "// SOUND_&_STYLE",
    "_src": [
     "music.copy.035"
    ]
   },
   {
    "tag": "h2.text-3xl.font-bold",
    "text": "Sound & Style",
    "_src": [
     "music.copy.036"
    ]
   },
   {
    "tag": "p.text-gray-400.font-mono",
    "text": "I have been making music on and off as a hobby since 2020, using it as a vital creative outlet. From the beginning, I found myself gravitating towards Liquid Drum & Bass, drawn by the sheer diversity of DnB as a genre, which has kept my focus ever since.",
    "_src": [
     "music.copy.037"
    ]
   },
   {
    "tag": "p.text-gray-400.font-mono",
    "text": "My workflow relies heavily on sampling from other tracks and moulding them to fit my signature sound. I see working with samples as akin to collaging, a tactile, layered art form I loved experimenting with during the early stages of my visual arts practice.",
    "_src": [
     "music.copy.038"
    ]
   },
